      "mergedPostDetails": "After spending a while in VRC, and successfully using the \"Go Home\" > \"Yes\" buttons several times, at one point, clicking \"Yes\" stopped doing anything.  I could still change worlds in other ways, but even after doing so, the \"Go Home\" button would work but the subsequent \"Yes\" button would not respond to clicking.\nRelaunching VRChat seems to have fixed it, and I'm not sure how to reproduce the bug, but I thought I'd at least bring it up in case anyone else has more information.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1238] Home button confirm stops working",
